{
  "title": "Dua of Imam Mahdi (a.t.f.s.) اَللّٰهُمَّ ادْفَعْ عَنْ وَلِيِّكَ...",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "The supplicatory prayer is as follows:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ ادْفَعْ عَنْ وَلِيِّكَ \nALLAAHUMMAD FA’ A’N WALIYYEKA \nO Allah, defend Your vicegerent, \nوَ خَلِيْفَتِكَ وَ حُجَّتِكَ عَلٰى خَلْقِكَ \nWA KHALEEFATEKA WA HUJJATEKA A’LAA KHALQEKA \nrepresentative, decisive argument against Your creatures \nوَ لِسَانِكَ الْمُعَبِّرِ عَنْكَ \nWA LESAANEKAL MO-A’BBARE A’NKAN \nand mouthpiece who speaks on behalf of You \nالنَّاطِقِ بِحِكْمَتِكَ \nNAATEQE BE-HIKMATEKA \nand speaks with Your wisdom, \nوَ عَيْنِكَ النَّاظِرَةِ باِذْنِكَ \nWA A’YNEKAN NAAZERATE BE-IZNEKA \nYour eye that sees with Your permission, \nوَ شَاهِدِكَ عَلٰى عِبَادِكَ \nWA SHA-HEDEKA A’LAA E’BAADEKAL \nYour witness on Your servants, \nالْجَحْجَاحِ الْمُجَاهِدِ الْعَاۤئِذِ بِكَ الْعَابِدِ عِنْدَكَ \nJAH-JAAHIL MOJAAHEDIL A’AA-EZE BEKAL A’A-BEDE I’NDAKA \nthe magnanimous master, the striver (for the sake of Allah), the seeker of Your shelter and the full worshipper in Your measures. \nوَ اَعِذْهُ مِنْ شَرِّ جَمِيْعِ مَا خَلَقْتَ \nWA A-I’ZHO MIN SHARRE JAMEE-E’ MAA KHALAQTA \nKeep him safe from the evils of all that which You created, \nوَ بَرَاْتَ وَ اَنْشَاْتَ وَ صَوَّرْتَ \nWA BARAATA WA AN-SHAATA WA SAWWARTA \noriginated, established and formed. \nوَ احْفَظْهُ مِنْ بَيْنِ يَدَيْهِ وَ مِنْ خَلْفِهٖ \nWAH FAZHO MIM BAYNE YADAYHE WA MIN KHALFEHI \nAnd protect him from the sides of his front, his back, \nوَ عَنْ يَّمِيْنِهٖ وَ عَنْ شِمَالِهٖ \nWA A’Y YAMEENEHI WA A’N SHEMAALEHI \nhis right, his left, \nوَ مِنْ فَوْقِهٖ وَ مِنْ تَحْتِهٖ \nWA MIN FAWQEHI WA MIN TAHTEHI \nabove him and beneath him, \nبِحِفْظِكَ الَّذِيْ لَا يُضِيْعُ مَنْ حَفِظْتَهٗ بِهٖ \nBE-HIFZEKAL LAZEE LAA YOZEE-O’ MAN HAFIZTAHU BEHI \nwith Your safety that preserves from any loss. \nوَ احْفَظْ فِيْهِ رَسُوْلَكَ \nWAH FAZ FEEHE RASOOLAKA \nAnd safeguard through him Your Messenger \nوَ اٰبَاۤئَهٗ اَئِمَّتَكَ وَ دَعَاۤئِمَ دِيْنِكَ \nWA AA-BAAA-AHU A-IMMATAKA WA DA-A’AA-EMA DEENEKA \nand his fathers; the Imams appointed by You and the pillars of Your religion. \nوَ اجْعَلْهُ فِيْ وَدِيْعَتِكَ الَّتِيْ لَا تَضِيْعُ \nWAJ A’LHO FEE WA-DEE-A’TEKAL LATEE LAA TAZEE-O’ \nAnd place him in Your deposit that is never lost, \nوَ فِيْ جِوَارِكَ الَّذِيْ لَا يُخْفَرُ \nWA FEE JEWAAREKAL LAZEE LAA YUKH-FARO \nin Your vicinity that is never violated \nوَ فِيْ مَنْعِكَ وَ عِزِّكَ الَّذِيْ لَا يُقْهَرُ \nWA FEE MAN-E’KA WA I’ZZEKAL LAZEE LAA YUQ-HARO \nand in Your protection and almightiness that are never defeated. \nوَ اٰمِنْهُ بِاَمَانِكَ الْوَثِيْقِ الَّذِيْ لَا يُخْذَلُ مَنْ اٰمَنْتَهٗ بِهٖ \nWA AA-MINHO BE-AMAANEKAL WASEEQIL LAZEE LAA YUKHZALO MAN AA-MANTAHU BEHI \nAnd secure him by Your well-firmed security that does not forsake whoever takes asylum in it. \nوَ اجْعَلْهُ فِيْ كَنَفِكَ الَّذِيْ لَا يُرَامُ مَنْ كَانَ فِيْهِ \nWAJ A’LHO FEE KA-NA-FEKAL LAZEE LAA YORAAMO MAN KAANA FEEHE \nAnd make him under Your protection that saves whoever is put under it from any harm. \nوَ انْصُرْهُ بِنَصْرِكَ الْعَزِيْزِ \nWAN SURHO BE-NASREKAL A’ZEEZE \nGrant him Your insuperable victory, \nوَ اَيِّدْهُ بِجُنْدِكَ الْغَالِبِ \nWA AYYID-HO BE-JUNDEKAL GHAA-LEBE \naid him with Your overcoming troops, \nوَ قَوِّهٖ بِقُوَّتِكَ وَ اَرْدِفْهُ بِمَلَاۤئِكَتِكَ \nWA QAWWEHI BE-QUWWATEKA WAR DIF-HO BE-MALAAA-EKATEKA \nstrengthen him with Your strength, put Your angels at his disposal, \nوَ وَالِ مَنْ وَالَاهُ وَ عَادِ مَنْ عَادَاهُ \nWA WAALE MAN WAALAAHO WA A’ADE MAN A’ADAAHO \nsupport whoever supports him, be the enemy of whoever opposes him, \nوَ اَلْبِسْهُ دِرْعَكَ الْحَصِيْنَةَ \nWA ALBISHO DIR-A’KAL HASEENATA \ndress him Your fortified armor \nوَ حُفَّهٗ بِالْمَلَاۤئِكَةِ حَفًّا \nWA HUFFAHU BIL-MALAAA-EKATE HAFFAN \nand make the angels surround him totally. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اشْعَبْ بِهِ الصَّدْعَ \nALLAAHUMMASH A’B BEHIS SAD-A’ \nO Allah, through him patch up the differences of opinion, \nوَ ارْتُقْ بِهِ الْفَتْقَ وَ اَمِتْ بِهِ الْجَوْرَ \nWAR TUQ BEHIL FATQA WA AMIT BEHIL JAWRA \nbring into order confusion, eradicate oppression, \nوَ اَظْهِرْ بِهِ الْعَدْلَ وَ زَيِّنْ بِطُوْلِ بَقَاۤئِهِ الْاَرْضَ \nWA AZ-HIR BEHIL A’DLA WA ZAYYIN BE-TOOLE BAQAAA-EHIL ARZA \nmanifest justice, adorn the earth by a lengthy life for him, \nوَ اَيِّدْهُ بِالنَّصْرِ وَ انْصُرْهُ بِالرُّعْبِ \nWA AYYIDHO BIN-NASRE WAN SURHO BIR-RO’BE \nsupport him with victory, grant him triumph by means of horror, \nوَ قَوِّ نَاصِرِيْهٖ وَ اخْذُلْ خَاذِلِيْهِ \nWA QAWWE NAASEREEHE WAKH ZUL KHAAZELEEHE \nreinforce his supporters, thwart his disappointers, \nوَ دَمْدِمْ مَنْ نَصَبَ لَهٗ وَ دَمِّرْ مَنْ غَشَّهٗ \nWA DAMDIM MAN NASABA LAHU WA DAMMIR MAN GHASHSHAHU \ncrush those who lay traps for him, destroy those who cheat him, \nوَ اقْتُلْ بِهٖ جَبَابِرَةَ الْكُفْرِ وَ عَمَدَهٗ وَ دَعَاۤئِمَهٗ\nWAQ TUL BEHI JABAABERATAL KUFRE WA A’MADAHU WA DA-A’AA-EMAHU\nkill the tyrants, pillars and supports of infidelity at his hands,\nوَ اقْصِمْ بِهٖ رُؤُوْسَ الضَّلَالَةِ \nWAQ SIM BEHI RO-OOSAZ ZALAALATE\nuproot the heads of deviation, \nوَ شَارِعَةَ الْبِدَعِ وَ مُمِيْتَةَ السُّنَّةِ \nWA SHAARE-A’TAL BE-DA-E’ WA MOMEETATAS SUNNATE \nthe innovators of heresies, the eradicators of the Prophetic traditions \nوَ مُقَوِّيَةَ الْبَاطِلِ وَ ذَلِّلْ بِهِ الْجَبَّارِيْنَ \nWA MOQAWWEYATAL BAATELE WA ZALLIL BEHIL JABBAAREENA \nand the backers of wrong, humiliate the haughty tyrants, \nوَ اَبِرْ بِهِ الْكَافِرِيْنَ وَ جَمِيْعَ الْمُلْحِدِيْنَ \nWA ABRE BEHIL KAAFEREENA WA JAMEE-A’L MULHEDEENA \nterminate the infidels and all atheists wherever they are – \nفِيْ مَشَارِقِ الْاَرْضِ وَ مَغَارِبِهَا \nFEE MASHAAREKIL ARZE WA MAGHAAREBEHAA \nin the east or the west of the earth \nوَ بَرِّهَا وَ بَحْرِهَا وَ سَهْلِهَا وَ جَبَلِهَا \nWA BARREHAA WA BAHREHAA WA SAH-LEHA WA JABALEHAA \nor in lands or oceans, or in plains or on mountains, \nحَتّٰى لَا تَدَعَ مِنْهُمْ دَيَّارًا وَ لَا تُبْقِيَ لَهُمْ اٰثارًا \nHATTAA LAA TADA’ MINHUM DAYYAARAN WA LAA TUBQEYA LAHUM AASAARAN \nuntil You will not leave a single one of them and You will not leave a single trace of them. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ طَهِّرْ مِنْهُمْ بِلَادَكَ \nALLAAHUMMA TAHHIR MINHUM BELAADAKA \nO Allah, clear up Your lands from them, \nوَ اشْفِ مِنْهُمْ عِبَادَكَ وَ اَعِزَّ بِهِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ \nWASH FE MINHUM E’BAADAKA WA-A-I’ZZA BEHIL MOMENEENA \nheal your servants’ hearts from them, consolidate the faithful believers through him, \nوَ اَحْيِ بِهٖ سُنَنَ الْمُرْسَلِيْنَ \nWA AHYE BEHI SONANAL MURSALEENA \nrevive the norms of the Messengers \nوَ دَارِسَ حُكْمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ \nWA DAARESA HUKMIN NABIYYEENA \nand the obliterated rules of the Prophets \nوَ جَدِّدْ بِهٖ مَا امْتَحٰى مِنْ دِيْنِكَ \nWA JADDID BEHI MAM TAHAA MIN DEENEKA \nand renew the signs of Your religion that were erased \nوَ بُدِّلَ مِنْ حُكْمِكَ حَتّٰى تُعِيْدَ دِيْنَكَ بِهٖ \nWA BUDDELA MIN HUKMEKA HATTAA TO-E’EDA DEENAKA BEHI \nand Your judgments that were distorted; until you rekindle Your religion through him \nوَ عَلٰى يَدَيْهِ جَدِيْدًا غَضًّا مَحْضًا صَحِيْحًا \nWA A’LAA YADAYHE JADEEDAN GHAZZAN MAHZAN SA-HEEHAN \nand at his hands as well-defined, pure and sound as it is; \nلَا عِوَجَ فِيْهِ وَ لَا بِدْعَةَ مَعَهٗ \nLAA E’WAJA FEEHE WA LAA BID-A’TA MA-A’HU \nfree from loopholes and heresies \nوَ حَتّٰى تُنِيْرَ بِعَدْلِهٖ ظُلَمَ الْجَوْرِ \nWA HATTAA TONEERA BE-A’DLEHI ZOLAMAL JAWRE\nand until You illumine the murk of unfairness by means of his justice, \nوَ تُطْفِئَ بِهٖ نِيْرَانَ الْكُفْرِ \nWA TUT-FE-A BEHI NEERAANAL KUFRE \nextinguish the fires of atheism though him \nوَ تُوْضِحَ بِهٖ مَعَاقِدَ الْحَقِّ \nWA TOOZEHA BEHI MA-A’A-QEDAL HAQQE \nand elucidate the positions of truth \nوَ مَجْهُوْلَ الْعَدْلِ فَاِنَّهٗ عَبْدُكَ الَّذِيْ \nWA MAJHOOLAL A’DLE FA-INNAHU A’BDOKAL LAZIS \nand the justice that will have been unknown. He is verily Your servant whom \nاسْتَخْلَصْتَهٗ لِنَفْسِكَ وَ اصْطَفَيْتَهٗ عَلٰى غَيْبِكَ \nTAKHLASTAHU LE-NAFSEKA WAS TAFAYTAHU A’LAA GHAYBEKA \nYou have saved for Yourself, chosen for keeping the unseen matters of You, \nوَ عَصَمْتَهٗ مِنَ الذُّنُوْبِ وَ بَرَاْتَهٗ مِنَ الْعُيُوْبِ \nWA A’SAMTAHU MENAZ ZONOOBE WA BARAAA-TAHU MENAL O’YOOBE \nprotected against sins, cleaned from any defect, \nوَ طَهَّرْتَهٗ مِنَ الرِّجْسِ وَ سَلَّمْتَهٗ مِنَ الدَّنَسِ \nWA TAHHARTAHU MENAR RIZSE WA SALLAM-TAHU MENAD DANASE \npurified from filth and kept sound against dirt. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَاِنَّا نَشْهَدُ لَهٗ يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ \nALLAHUMMA FA-INNAA NASH-HADO LAHU YAWMAL QEYAAMATE \nO Allah, we will verily testify to him on the Day of Resurrection \nوَ يَوْمَ حُلُوْلِ الطَّآمَّةِ اَنَّهٗ لَمْ يُذْنِبْ ذَنْبًا \nWA YAWMA HOLOOLIT TAAAM-MATE ANNAHU LAM YUZNIB ZAMBAW \nand on the day when the overwhelming event comes that he did not commit any single sin, \nوَّ لَاۤ اَتٰى حُوْبًا وَ لَمْ يَرْتَكِبْ مَعْصِيَةً \nWA LAA ATAA HOOBAW WA LAM YAR-TAKIB MA’SEYATAW \nnor did he practice any unlawful thing, nor did he do any act of disobedience (to You), \nوَّ لَمْ يُضَيِّعْ لَكَ طَاعَةً وَّ لَمْ يَهْتِكْ لَكَ حُرْمَةً \nWA LAM YOZAYYE’ LAKA TAA-A’TAW WA LAM YAHTIK LAKA HURMATAW \nnor did he miss any act of obedience (to You), nor did he violate any inviolable thing, \nوَّ لَمْ يُبَدِّلْ لَكَ فَرِيْضَةً وَّ لَمْ يُغَيِّرْ لَكَ شَرِيْعَةً \nWA LAM YOBADDIL LAKA FAREEZATAW WA LAM YOGHAYYIR LAKA SHA-REE-A’TAW \nnor did he distort any precept, nor did he change any law. \nوَّ اَنَّهُ الْهَادِى الْمُهْتَدِيْ الطَّاهِرُ \nWA ANNAHUL HAADIL MOHTADIT TAA-HERUT \nAnd, moreover, he is verily the guiding, the rightly guided, \nالتَّقِيُّ النَّقِيُّ الرَّضِيُّ الزَّكِيُّ \nTAQIYYUN NAQIYYUR RAZIYYUZ ZAKIYYO \nthe pure, the pious, the immaculate, the approved and the bright. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَعْطِهٖ فِىْ نَفْسِهٖ وَ اَهْلِهٖ وَ وَلَدِهٖ \nALLAAHUMMA A-A’TEHI FEE NAFSEHI WA AHLEHI WA WALADEHI \nO Allah, give him what he wishes regarding his own self his family, his sons, \nوَ ذُرِّيَّتِهٖ وَ اُمَّتِهٖ وَ جَمِيْعِ رَعِيَّتِهٖ \nWA ZURRIYYATEHI WA UMMATEHI WA JAMEE-E’ RA-I’YYATEHI \nhis offspring, his nation and all of his subjects \nمَا تُقِرُّ بِهٖ عَيْنَهٗ وَ تَسُرُّ بِهٖ نَفْسَهٗ \nMAA TOQIRRO BEHI A’YNAHU WA TASURRO BEHI NAFSAHU \nin such a way that makes him delighted and pleased in himself \nوَ تَجْمَعُ لَهٗ مُلْكَ الْمُمْلَكَاتِ كُلِّهَا \nWA TAJ-MA-O’ LAHU MULKAL MUMLAKAATE KULLEHAA \nand makes You put under his sphere of influence all kingdoms; \nقَرِيْبِهَا وَ بَعِيْدِهَا وَ عَزِيْزِهَا وَ ذَلِيْلِهَا \nQAREEBEHAA WA BA-E’EDEHAA WA A’ZEEZEHAA WA ZALEELEHAA \nthe near and the remote and the powerful and the weak \nحَتّٰى تُجْرِيَ حُكْمُهٗ عَلٰى كُلِّ حُكْمٍ \nHATTAA TUJREYA HUKMOHU A’LAA KULLE HUKMIW \nso that You will cause his rule to prevail over every rule \nوَّ تَغْلِبَ بِحَقِّهٖ عَلٰي كُلِّ بَاطِلٍ \nWA TAGHLEBA BE-HAQQEHI A’LAA KULLE BAATELIN \nand his right (issue) to overcome the entire wrongness. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ اسْلُكْ بِنَا عَلٰى يَدَيْهِ مِنْهَاجَ الْهُدٰى \nALLAAHUMMAS LUK BENAA A’LAA YADAYHE MINHAAJAL HODAA \nO Allah, lead us at his hands to the course of guidance, \nوَ الْمَحَجَّةَ الْعُظْمٰى وَ الطَّرِيْقَةَ الْوُسْطَى \nWAL MA-HAJJATAL U’ZMAA WAT TAREEQATAL WUSTAL \nthe greatest Path and the equitable way of life \nالَّتِيْ يَرْجِعُ اِلَيْهَا الْغَالِيْ وَ يَلْحَقُ بِهَا التَّالِيْ \nLATEE YAR-JE-O’ ELAYHAL GHAALEE WA YALHAQO BEHAT TAALEE \nto which those who had gone too far will come back (repentant) and those who had fallen down will catch up. \nوَ قَوِّنَا عَلٰى طَاعَتِهٖ وَ ثَبِّتْنَا عَلٰى مُشَايَعَتِهٖ \nWA QAWWENAA A’LAA TAA-A’TEHI WA SABBITNAA A’LAA MOSHAA-YA-A’TEHI \nAnd encourage us to carry out acts of obedience to him, make us stand firmly in following him, \nوَ امْنُنْ عَلَيْنَا بِمُتَابَعَتِهٖ \nWAM NUN A’LAYNAA BE-MOTAA-BA-A’TEHI \nendue us with the favor of adherence to him \nوَ اجْعَلْنَا فِيْ حِزْبِهِ الْقَوَّامِيْنَ بِاَمْرِهِ \nWAJ A’LNAA FEE HIZBEHIL QAWWAAMEENA BE-AMREHIS \nand include us with his group who achieve his commands, \nالصَّابِرِيْنَ مَعَهُ الطَّالِبِيْنَ رِضَاكَ \nSAABEREENA MA-A’HUT TAALE-BEENA REZAAKA \nact steadfastly towards him and seek Your pleasure \nبِمُنَاصَحَتِهٖ حَتّٰى تَحْشُرَنَا يَوْمَ الْقِيَامَةِ \nBE-MONAASAHATEHI HATTAA TAH-SHORANAA YAWMAL QEYAAMATE \nby means of acting sincerely to him, so that You will gather us on the Resurrection Day \nفِي اَنْصَارِهٖ وَ اَعْوَانِهٖ وَ مُقَوِّيَةِ سُلْطَانِهٖ \nFEE ANSAAREHI WA A-A’WAANEHI WA MOQAWWEYATE SULTAANEHI \nwith his supporters, backers and those who consolidate his authority. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ اجْعَلْ ذٰلِكَ لَنَا خَالِصًا مِّنْ كُلِّ شَكٍّ \nALLAAHUMMA WAJ A’L ZAALEKA LANAA KHAA-LESAM MIN KULLE SHAKKIW \nO Allah, make us do all these things free from any doubt, \nوَّ شُبْهَةٍ وَّ رِيَاۤءٍ وَّ سُمْعَةٍ \nWA SHUBHATIW WA REYAAA-IW WA SUM-A’TIN \nconfusion, ostentation and seeking of reputation \nحَتّٰى لَانَعْتَمِدَ بِهٖ غَيْرَكَ \nHATTAA LAA NA’TAMEDA BEHI GHAYRAKA \nso that we will rely upon none save You \nوَ لَا نَطْلُبَ بِهٖ اِلَّا وَجْهَكَ \nWA LAA NATLOBA BEHI ILLAA WAJHAKA \nand seek none save Your sake \nوَ حَتّٰى تُحِلَّنَا مَحَلَّهٗ \nWA HATTAA TO-HILLANAA MA-HALLAHU \nand that You will put us up in his vicinity \nوَ تَجْعَلَنَا فِي الْجَنَّةِ مَعَهٗ \nWA TAJ-A’LANAA FIL JANNATE MA-A’HU \nand place us with him in Paradise. \nوَ اَعِذْنَا مِنَ السَّاْمَةِ وَ الْكَسَلِ وَ الْفَتْرَةِ\nWA A-I’ZNAA MENAS SAA-MATE WAL KASALE WAL FATRATE\nAnd protect us against weariness, laziness and lethargy \nوَ اجْعَلْنَا مِمَّنْ تَنْتَصِرُبِهٖ لِدِيْنِكَ \nWAJ A’LNAA MIMMAN TAN-TASERO BEHI LE-DEENEKA \nand include us with those whom You take up for backing Your religion \nوَ تُعِزُّ بِهٖ نَصْرَ وَلِيِّكَ \nWA TO-I’ZZO BEHI NASRA WALIYYEKA \nand for increasing the victory of Your vicegerent. \nوَ لَا تَسْتَبْدِلْ بِنَا غَيْرَنَا \nWA LAA TAS-TAB-DIL BENAA GHAYRANAA \nDo not put others in our places, \nفَاِنَّ اسْتِبْدَالَكَ بِنَا غَيْرَنَا عَلَيْكَ يَسِيْرٌ \nFA-INNAS TIBDAALAKA BENAA GHAYRANAA A’LAYKA YASEERUW \nbecause it is easy for You to put others in our places, \nوَّ هُوَ عَلَيْنَا كَثِيْرٌ \nWA HOWA A’LAYNAA KASEERUN \nbut it is extremely difficult for us if You do it. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى وُلَاةِ عَهْدِهٖ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA WOLAATE A’HDEHI \nO Allah, send blessings upon his representatives \nوَ الْاَئِمَّةِ مِنْ بَعْدِهٖ \nWAL A-IMMATE MIM BA’DEHI \nand the leaders after him, \nوَ بَلِّغْهُمْ اٰمَالَهُمْ وَ زِدْ فِي اٰجَالِهِمْ \nWA BALLIGHHUM AAMAALAHUM WA ZID FEE AAJAALEHIM \nmake them attain their wishes, increase their lifetimes, \nوَ اَعِزَّ نَصْرَهُمْ \nWA A-I’ZZA NASRAHUM \nsupport their victory, \nوَ تَمِّمْ لَهُمْ مَا اَسْنَدْتَ اِلَيْهِمْ مِنْ اَمْرِكَ لَهُمْ \nWA TAMMIM LAHUM MAA AS-NADTA ELAYHIM MIN AMREKA LAHUM \nmake perfect for them Your orders that You bid them to carry out, \nوَ ثَبِّتْ دَعَاۤئِمَهُمْ وَ اجْعَلْنَا لَهُمْ اَعْوَانًا \nWA SABBIT DA-A’AA-EMAHUM WAJ A’LNAA LAHUM A-A’WAANAW\nstrengthen their pillars and make us their helpers \nوَّ عَلٰى دِيْنِكَ اَنْصَارًا \nWA A’LAA DEENEKA ANSAARAN \nand supporters of Your religion. \nفَاِنَّهُمْ مَعَادِنُ كَلِمَاتِكَ \nFA-INNAHUM MA-A’A-DENO KALEMAATEKA \nThey are the essence of Your Words, \nوَ خُزَّانُ عِلْمَكَ وَ اَرْكَانُ تَوْحِيْدِكَ \nWA KHUZZAANO I’LMEKA WA ARKAANO TAWHEEDEKA \nthe hoarders of Your knowledge, the pillars of the profession of Your Oneness, \nوَ دَعَاۤئِمُ دِيْنِكَ وَ وُلَاةُ اَمْرِكَ \nWA DA-A’AA-EMO DEENEKA WA WOLAATO AMREKA \nthe posts of Your religion, the authorities of Your commands, \nوَ خَالِصَتُكَ مِنْ عِبَادِكَ \nWA KHAALESATOKA MIN E’BAADEKA \nthe choices over Your servants, \nوَ صَفْوَتُكَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ \nWA SAFWATOKA MIN KHALQEKA \nthe well-chosen ones from among Your creatures, \nوَ اَوْلِيَاۤئُكَ وَ سَلَاۤئِلُ اَوْلِيَاۤئِكَ \nWA AWLE-YAAA-OKA WA SALAAA-ELO AWLE-YAAA-EKA \nthe vicegerents of You, the offspring of Your vicegerents \nوَ صَفْوَةُ اَوْلَادِ نَبِيِّكَ \nWA SAFWATO AWLAADE NABIYYEKA \nand the selected descendants of Your Prophet. \nوَ السَّلَامُ عَلَيْهِ وَ عَلَيْهِمْ \nWAS-SALAAMO A’LAYHE WA A’LAYHIM \nPeace be upon him and them. \nوَرَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَبَرَكاتُهٗ.\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU.\nAllah’s mercy and blessings, too, be upon them.",
  "merits": "Sayyed Ibn Taaoos says: When you intend to leave the holy sanctuary of Imam al-Mahdi (a.s.), you may return to the sublime vault and offer as many prayers as you wish therein. You may then stand up, turn your face towards the qiblah direction, and say this supplicatory prayer.\nYou may then pray Almighty Allah as much as you can and leave with happiness, Allah willing.\nAs for Shaykh al-Tusi, he, in his book of Misbah al-Mutahajjid, reported this supplicatory prayer from Imam al-Reza (a.s.) within the rites on Fridays. Hereinafter, we will record this supplicatory prayer according to the narration of Shaykh al-Tusi, who said:\nIt is narrated from Yunus ibn Abd al-Rahman that Imam Ali ibn Moosa al-Reza, peace be upon him, used to order his companions and adherents to say the following supplicatory prayer for sake of Imam al-Mahdi (a.t.f.s.). Besides, it is strongly recommended to say it after the ziyarah of Imam al-Mahdi, peace be upon him. "
}
